<h3 id="row-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#row-props"><span>Row Props</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>参数名</th>
<th>描述</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th style="text-align:center">默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>gutter</td>
<td>栅格间隔，单位是<code v-pre>px</code> 栅格间隔。可传入响应式对象写法 { xs: 4, sm: 6, md: 12}，传入数组 [ 水平间距， 垂直间距 ] 来设置两个方向。</td>
<td><code v-pre>number| ResponsiveValue| [number | ResponsiveValue, number | ResponsiveValue]</code></td>
<td style="text-align:center"><code v-pre>0</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>justify</td>
<td>水平对齐方式 (<code v-pre>justify-content</code>)</td>
<td><code v-pre>'start' | 'center' | 'end' | 'space-around' | 'space-between'</code></td>
<td style="text-align:center"><code v-pre>'start'</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>align</td>
<td>竖直对齐方式 ( <code v-pre>align-items</code> )</td>
<td><code v-pre>'start' | 'center' | 'end' | 'stretch'</code></td>
<td style="text-align:center"><code v-pre>'start'</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>div</td>
<td>开启这个选项<code v-pre>Row</code>和<code v-pre>Col</code>都会被当作div而不会附带任何Grid相关的类和样式</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td style="text-align:center"><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>wrap</td>
<td><code v-pre>Col</code> 是否支持换行</td>
<td><code v-pre>boolean</code></td>
<td style="text-align:center"><code v-pre>true</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
